<p> ISSUED/ACCEPTED  30.022 BLN USD		 CUSIP    9127946Z2</p>
<p> BIDS SUBMITTED   64.243			   COUNTRY	  USA</p>
<p> NONCOMPETITIVE   NONE ALLOWED		    AUCTION AVERAGES</p>
